content:
@martykendall2 @AmeliaIsBchBum There is a fair bit of data on malnutrition, sarcopenia &amp; GLP1's.
Advocating is easy, but with a significantly diminished appetite or inability to digest, the reality can  become somewhat different.
Tirzepatide at least appears to improve FatOx and thereby reduce energy deficit.

@The_Feminist_TM Then how do you explain the fact Mounjaro &amp; the upcoming new meds result in greater weight loss?

They restrict appetite harder? 😅

In reality, there is clearly some biological effect on metabolism or digestion, etc that’s also operative

@The_Feminist_TM One would imagine that weight loss as dramatic as that reported couldn’t simply be due to calorie restriction 

Just to begin with, there would be no explanation as to why medications like Mounjaro are more effective

There is only so much appetite can be suppressed

@BritMartinez Friend almost died from a severe allergic reaction to Mounjaro after he had already been using it for a while.

He was not diabetic or obese...just trying to lose those stubborn pounds common to folks in their 50s.

These meds are being far too overprescribed in my opinion

@RealityByAshley I’m already taking Mounjaro for T2Diabetes  
The weight loss is no joke Ive read it’s even faster for non diabetics. If I could have lost 40 pounds I might not have gotten Diabetes. Get healthy I say!! 
Lose those stubborn pounds! ☘️🩷

@Dane__Garcia This is concerning to me as it is used as diabetic medication as well.

My family member has lost unbelievable weight due to the Mounjaro.

Perhaps our country needs to improve our medicine trials especially after the COVID crisis.

@cionmamii Ozempic or Mounjaro? 

You lost a human and a half. 

You look stunning! 👏🏽

@SneakerPurple I have been strict keto/carnivore for a year. I have maybe 10 carbs a day. The only success I've had is getting my A1C down from 7 to 5.7. I haven't lost any weight.
I am beyond frustrated.
I'm thinking about starting Mounjaro even though I really wanted to do this on my own.

@EliLillyandCo @TetroD65n24 I am diabetic. Been taking Mounjaro for a couple months and I love it 

I have lost 20 lbs and my blood sugar numbers are much better. 

But now I can’t find Mounjaro anywhere. @Walgreens just advises to call around😡

@Big__TeeJ @datepsych I have a  6’6” high IQ professional friend who weighed 325 lbs, that in 2022 I recommended tirzepatide to.

He lost 110 lbs, now has a BMI of 21, and feels great.

Why haven’t you availed yourself of a GLP-1, are you too smart for that?

@veldajoy There’s high risk patients for sure. These meds aren’t 4everyone. 
I have T2Diabetes &amp; I’ve been on Mounjaro. for 8months now &amp; my 
blood sugar, cholesterol &amp; blood pressure are finally normal. Thankfully my doctor tracks my symptoms &amp; progress closely I hope to live until I’m 80

@DrEliDavid I had a 60 year-old man on 150 units of Insulin, do low-carb diet and low dose Mounjaro.  He lost 110 lbs- from 295 lb, and went off Insulin.

Type I diabetes REQUIRES Insulin use.

In Type II diabetes, Insulin is often detrimental to the heart/ brain/ liver and CAUSES obesity!

@TheView #TheView #WhoopiGoldberg #Reveals She Took Weight Loss Drugs #Mounjaro
After #Hitting300Pounds While Filming The Movie '#Till'. #SunnyHostin also admit that she gained 40 pounds during the COVID pandemic. She also used Mounjaro.
https://t.co/OEsKgp6MDB

@justMM24 @SurprisedWhy @KaiseratCB For reference, I lost 20 lbs in the five months I was on Mounjaro and have lost another 25 pounds in the six months I've been off it. 
And being lighter and the joy of new clothes is also a good incentive to increase exercise to continue/maintain the loss. 
Good luck to you!

@StevieVanZandt Have him call me. I dropped 65 pounds last year to control pre-diabetes using Mounjaro and a great doc. 

(Before-After)

I’m not an ‘influencer’. Nowhere close. https://t.co/yhUi2gTzcl

@EliLillyandCo 

Good Morning ,

I’m honestly very confused why you guys haven’t reached out to me I’m not only the guy in the Zepbound commercial but I also have lost more weight than anyone on Mounjaro and Zepbound , I’m a A list director and producer for Sony and MTV and my TikTok following is full of people who are not bots and legit powerhouses on TikTok , I have lost more than anyone else on Mounjaro that’s from Eli Lilly’s mouth director I lost 150lbs on Mounjaro and Zepbound combined so I’m really confused why your reaching out to mainly females and not people like myself who have an extensive social media following and a lot of clout in the entertainment industry,

@subnomnomnom It is not about adjusting, you stay on Mounjaro or Ozempic the rest of your life. Just like medicine for High Blood Pressure or Thyroid conditions or Heart Disease.

March 1, '23, AIC was 6.7, and at 6' tall, I weighed in at 350 pounds. 
Feb 1, '24 (11 months) A1C-5.2, weigh-253

@Jaded_Chinx @ludanmama I had insulin resistance (pre diabetes) 
I tried Weight Watchers, Adkins, 
meal delivery service with regular exercise but couldn’t lose weight no matter what…eventually was diagnosed with TYP2 Diabetes in August ‘23 prescribed MOUNJARO lost 40 pounds with normal blood sugars.

@arcarver87 You and me both.

Anecdotal reports for Mounjaro and similar meds is that it not only helps with things such as overeating due to appetite suppressant, but it may also help with other compulsive behaviors/addictions like gambling, shopping, drinking, etc. 
I'd like to learn more.

@danishacarterr I took Mounjaro 5ml and lost the weight I'd put on after surgery (5 years ago). 
I went from sz 18 to 12 and i now exercise without knee and hip pain. 
Went off it and went up 1 pound in the first week which I've dropped. Couldn't be doing this exercise without the weightloss.

@DoctorTro "It's all about insulin" 

 "How does Mounjaro/Ozempic work?" 

"Stimulation of Insulin Release and Appetite Regulation"

@ro I lost 65 pounds in the last 9 months. Don’t do this without a doctor supervising. 
Ozempic made me so nauseous all day, everyday that I couldn’t eat if I wanted to. Unsustainable!!
Mounjaro is so much better. No nausea. Lost weight quickly. Feel great.

@KevinH_PhD @WCIRDC Interesting presentation.
How much of the appetite dampening is a function of increased lipid oxidation with tirzepatide, and could this explain the earlier plateau with sema?
What role may adaptation play in the appetite dampening and what would be the long-term implications?

@DrSuneelDhand &gt;&gt;This mass prescribing of Ozempic is going to backfire big time.

Easy to say.  But what are the problems that you see?

BTW - I am on Mounjaro and have lost a lot of weight.  Not yet where I want to get.

@MdBreathe @elonmusk I’m a Neurosurgeon who has tried Mounjaro
You absolutely don’t want food or alcohol 
Lost 15 pounds

@ianmiles @elonmusk I looked at all completed and in progress clinical trials for Mounjaro and saw only CVD safety end points observed.

Also, these drugs have only been out for a New York minute.

Blanket, absolute statements about safety, are unscientific.

@HumanBollard Been on the mounjaro for a month - a real game changer for me.

No interest in food or booze (2/3/4 pints after work was my downfall) and I can’t stomach takeaways or greasy food.

Lost a stone already aiming for another 2 to get me back to my old football weight of 12.5 stone.

@ShannonJoyRadio I believe this is the reason for the new plant. 

The US Food and Drug Administration approved Eli Lilly's drug, named Zepbound. The drug, also known as tirzepatide, helped dieters lose as much as 40 to 60 pounds in testing.Nov 9, 2023
It's a big push to get this weight loss drug

@endofanerajc I lost 100 lbs on Ozempic, now continuing on Mounjaro.

Now, about the mentally stable part… 

Just kidding. Luv ya.

@Grimhood 4 months on Mounjaro, zero of these issues. 
I exercise, keep a high protein intake and only loose about 1kg/w. Even just hit a small plateau after having lost 10% of body weight.
It's for sale in Belgium now at 233 euro price point! Might be time to come visit Bruges dear USA

