4️⃣ fearmongered about an alleged  "loss of civil rights" after Tuesday's results as an alibi to keep denying the importance of prioritizing food access (bread and butter issues) for the working class; all that while being a millionaire who has access to so much food that she has admitted to using appetite regulating medications (i.e. Mounjaro, at a monthly price of $1100 to $1400, according to @PaytientApp) and she has also acknowledged undergoing extensive liposuction.

